Ek aur important baat

HttpExchange khud network par request nahi bhej raha. Ye declarative definition hai. Spring is definition ke basis par HTTP client infrastructure use karta hai.

Isliye abhi tum WebClient seekh rahe ho, toh pehle ye samajh:

WebClient mein tum HTTP request banate ho.
HttpExchange mein tum HTTP request ka description dete ho.

